OL,3,GNEWSAEx-miners optimistic pension cash
OL,4,Awill be released
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer miners say they are hopeful a
OL,7,Fdecades-long pensions battle could come
OL,8,Fto an end when the government unveils
OL,9,Fits Budget later.
OL,11,FMineworkers say they lost out after the
OL,12,FConservative administration took over
OL,13,Fthe miners' pension scheme when British
OL,14,FCoal was privatised in 1994.
OL,16,FAt that point it was guaranteed by
OL,17,Fministers that the value of the fund
OL,18,Fwould not decrease - but the government
OL,19,Fwas allowed to keep half of any
OL,20,Finvestment surplus.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
