OL,3,GNEWSAEx-miners optimistic pension cash
OL,4,Awill be released
OL,5,
OL,6,FRetired miners hope Chancellor John
OL,7,FHealey will finally end that
OL,8,Farrangement in the Budget on Wednesday
OL,9,Fafter trade minister Blair McDougall
OL,10,Ftold Parliament "the hard work and
OL,11,Fsacrifice of coalminers must be
OL,12,Facknowledged".
